# Publishers return 403 to the link checker. Sphinx linkcheck ignores the same hosts.
https://pubs\.acs\.org/
https://onlinelibrary\.wiley\.com/
https://pubs\.aip\.org/
https://aip\.scitation\.org/
https://www\.tandfonline\.com/
https://journals\.aps\.org/
https://link\.aps\.org/
https://pubs\.rsc\.org/
https://www\.sciencedirect\.com/

# doi.org follows the redirect onto those publishers, which then return 403.
# APS returns 403 to the link checker. The DOIs are valid.
https://doi\.org/10\.1021/
https://doi\.org/10\.1002/
https://doi\.org/10\.1063/
https://doi\.org/10\.1080/
https://doi\.org/10\.1103/

# The Wilf notes host returns 403, including to a browser user agent.
https://www\.math\.upenn\.edu/~wilf/
https://www2\.math\.upenn\.edu/~wilf/

